 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video\n\neCommerce/D2C Listing Videos - Most D2C buyers abandon eCom pages without completing a purchase as they aren’t convinced by images alone. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, then producing Marketplace-Optimized Videos & Images, that increase ‘Add-to-Cart’ by building customer trust, ready to get listed on Amazon, Shopify & more.\n\n#AIAdFilm #AICommercial #AIVideoProduction #AIGeneratedVideo #GenerativeAI\n#CGICommercial #CGIAd #VFXCommercial #VFXAd\n#VirtualProduction #NoShootAd #VirtualAd\n#FutureOfAdvertising #AIInMarketing #DigitalAdvertising\n#BrandFilm #AdFilm #ProductAd #3DCommercial", "channel_id": "UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "duration": 28, "view_count": 45, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LQQ77soKs1Q", "categories": ["Film & Animation"], "tags": ["AI ad film", "AI commercial", "AI generated video", "AI video production", "generative AI advertising", "CGI commercial", "CGI ad film", "VFX commercial", "VFX ad film", "virtual production ad", "no shoot advertisement", "virtual ad film", "digital advertising", "future of advertising", "AI marketing video", "brand film", "product ad video", "3D commercial", "synthetic media", "creative technology", "AI content creation", "next gen advertising", "AI powered ads", "virtual filmmaking", "AI visual effects"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {"en-orig": [{"ext": "json3", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=LQQ77soKs1Q&ei=MypWasGbLdCw0u8PrJTfoAM&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=